Overworld Co-Op Online Mod
============================

Multiplayer online overworld co-op exploration, hosting/joining via project server relay with 6-character Room Codes!

Features:
- HOST SERVER: Connects to public relay server and generates 6-character Room Code (e.g. X7K9P2).
- JOIN SERVER: Enter 6-character Room Code to join anywhere over NAT.
- Live overworld player movement, facing, and sprite synchronization.
- 3D Voxel diorama billboard rendering support for Player 2.
- Facing P2 and pressing A opens Co-Op Menu (PVP BATTLE, TRADE).
- 100% compatible with Voxel 3D, Followers, Overworld Encounters, and Debug Menu.
